WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.706
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.706 --> 00:00:27.130
Tap Management, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:30.322
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.322 --> 00:00:34.551
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.551 --> 00:00:40.189
Type your PIN.

6
00:00:40.189 --> 00:00:45.693
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.693 --> 00:00:51.414
This is the Instructor Panel: Records, Add New and Export.

8
00:00:51.414 --> 00:00:58.104
Backups live on the Export tab.

9
00:00:58.104 --> 00:01:04.212
Automatic Backup to iCloud is on for every center.

10
00:01:04.212 --> 00:01:11.815
Each day a backup, and this month’s spreadsheet, go to your own iCloud.

11
00:01:11.815 --> 00:01:18.654
Any iPad signed in to the same Apple Account can restore it.

12
00:01:18.654 --> 00:01:26.930
To send one right now, tap Back Up & Sync Now.

13
00:01:26.930 --> 00:01:35.733
If iCloud ever needs attention, an amber warning appears beside the gear.
